; FXRE_Hybrid_EA Aggressive — RiskPerTradePct=1.0, Min_RR=1.0, ScalpMode ON, quick TP
; Scope: XAU/XAG + EURUSD+ only, US30 out of scope. Sessions in PH (UTC+8), wide (filter OFF):
; London-wide 14-01 PH / NY-wide 19-06 PH (take effect if UseSessionFilter re-enabled)
